    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269500/extras/ba191301bafd79a897b1e513f6017213.poster.avif?t=1684919943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269500/extras/ba191301bafd79a897b1e513f6017213.webm?t=1684919943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Prepare for an unforgettable adventure in <strong>Leap of Legends</strong>, a thrilling <strong>2D platformer</strong> game where players battle it out in <strong>PvP</strong> and <strong>PvE</strong> modes. Choose your favorite animal character and customize them with weapons and gear to suit your playstyle. With multiple characters and game modes, there's never a dull moment in <strong>Leap of Legends</strong>. As you progress, you'll unlock new characters and weapons, allowing you to take on even more significant challenges and become a true legend of the game. So, jump into the action and show the world what you're made of in <strong>Leap of Legends</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269500/extras/3773ffd2c1af4ac80615d36265f1b5d0.poster.avif?t=1684919943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269500/extras/3773ffd2c1af4ac80615d36265f1b5d0.webm?t=1684919943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269500/extras/ba191301bafd79a897b1e513f6017213.poster.avif?t=1684919943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269500/extras/ba191301bafd79a897b1e513f6017213.webm?t=1684919943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Prepare for an unforgettable adventure in <strong>Leap of Legends</strong>, a thrilling <strong>2D platformer</strong> game where players battle it out in <strong>PvP</strong> and <strong>PvE</strong> modes. Choose your favorite animal character and customize them with weapons and gear to suit your playstyle. With multiple characters and game modes, there's never a dull moment in <strong>Leap of Legends</strong>. As you progress, you'll unlock new characters and weapons, allowing you to take on even more significant challenges and become a true legend of the game. So, jump into the action and show the world what you're made of in <strong>Leap of Legends</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269500/extras/3773ffd2c1af4ac80615d36265f1b5d0.poster.avif?t=1684919943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269500/extras/3773ffd2c1af4ac80615d36265f1b5d0.webm?t=1684919943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
